; The vocabulary of the model which does not load.
;
; It is the same vocabulary as the model beside it, minus the invariant: no rule
; here will ever run, because a model which does not load runs none. What this
; root is for is the other side of the gate — a file which does not parse, whose
; diagnostic carries a span, and a node naming a type nobody declared.
(project
  (label "Gate self-test, unloadable")
  (globalid-namespace "https://example.org/models/gate-self-test-unloadable"))
(namespace frame (description "Coordinate frames declared by this model."))
(namespace site (description "Semantic nodes minted by this model."))
(type
  MeetingRoom
  (kind Space)
  (geometry area)
  (description "An enclosed room used for meetings."))
(frame frame:building (label "Building local grid") (unit m))
